OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn online grooming of
OL,4,Achildren is 'getting easier'
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts are urging parents to talk to
OL,7,Ftheir children amid warnings online
OL,8,Fgrooming is becoming "quicker" and
OL,9,F"easier" than ever before.
OL,11,FChildline said Snapchat, TikTok and
OL,12,FInstagram were the top platforms
OL,13,Fchildren named in counselling about
OL,14,Fonline sexual abuse last year. The
OL,15,Fcompanies have been approached for
OL,16,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
